@startuml
title Zenval — Infrastructure adapters và durable records
caption PROPOSED TARGET — chưa phải implementation / scope MVP đã duyệt
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty methods
left to right direction
package "Inward-owned ports" {
  interface RepositoryPort
  interface UnitOfWork
  interface SnapshotQueryPort
  interface OutboxPort
  interface JobQueuePort
  interface MarketDataPort
  interface ObjectStoragePort
  interface NotificationDeliveryPort
  interface DataRightsPort
}
package "Infrastructure (proposed adapters)" {
  class DrizzleContextRepository {
    +find(workspaceId, id)
    +save(aggregate, expectedVersion, tx)
  }
  class PostgresUnitOfWork
  class SqlSnapshotQueryAdapter
  class PostgresOutboxAdapter
  class OutboxDispatcher
  class QueueHttpAdapter <<pilot candidate>>
  class SignedJobEndpoint
  class JobRunner
  class ProviderMarketDataAdapter
  class ObjectStorageAdapter
  class EmailDeliveryAdapter
  class ContextDataRightsAdapter
  class PersistenceMapper
  class FinancialCryptoGateway <<sole crypto module>>
}
DrizzleContextRepository ..|> RepositoryPort
PostgresUnitOfWork ..|> UnitOfWork
SqlSnapshotQueryAdapter ..|> SnapshotQueryPort
PostgresOutboxAdapter ..|> OutboxPort
QueueHttpAdapter ..|> JobQueuePort
ProviderMarketDataAdapter ..|> MarketDataPort
ObjectStorageAdapter ..|> ObjectStoragePort
EmailDeliveryAdapter ..|> NotificationDeliveryPort
ContextDataRightsAdapter ..|> DataRightsPort
DrizzleContextRepository ..> PersistenceMapper : envelopes <-> domain
PersistenceMapper --> FinancialCryptoGateway : encrypt / authorized decrypt
SqlSnapshotQueryAdapter --> FinancialCryptoGateway : authorized decrypt
PostgresOutboxAdapter --> FinancialCryptoGateway : encrypted payload
JobRunner --> FinancialCryptoGateway : authorized job payload
OutboxDispatcher ..> PostgresOutboxAdapter : claim SKIP LOCKED
OutboxDispatcher ..> JobQueuePort : enqueue job ID
SignedJobEndpoint --> JobRunner : verify signature / atomic claim
JobRunner ..> OutboxPort : versioned events after work
package "PostgreSQL logical records (TARGET, not migrations)" {
  entity ContextBusinessRow {
    id: UUID
    workspace_id: UUID
    created_at: timestamptz
    updated_at: timestamptz
    version: integer
    encrypted_payload: EncryptedEnvelope
  }
  entity ImmutableFact {
    id: UUID
    workspace_id: UUID
    recorded_at: timestamptz
    encrypted_payload: EncryptedEnvelope
  }
  entity OutboxEvent {
    event_id: UUID
    workspace_id: UUID
    routing_type: generic opaque code
    schema_version: integer
    aggregate_id: UUID
    emitted_at: technical timestamptz
    correlation_id: string
    causation_id: string
    payload: EncryptedEnvelope
    processing_state: string
  }
  entity InboxConsumption {
    event_id: UUID
    handler_name: generic opaque code
    consumed_at: timestamptz
    UNIQUE(event_id, handler_name)
  }
  entity DurableJob {
    job_id: UUID
    workspace_id: UUID
    status: queued / running / succeeded / failed / dead
    attempts: integer
    next_retry_at: timestamptz
    heartbeat_at: timestamptz
    checkpoint: opaque cursor
    deduplication_key: opaque keyed fingerprint
  }
  entity IdempotencyResult {
    workspace_id: UUID
    actor_id: UUID
    scope: generic opaque code
    key_hash: string
    request_mac: keyed HMAC
    encrypted_response: EncryptedEnvelope
    UNIQUE(workspace_id, actor_id, scope, key_hash)
  }
  entity ProjectionRecord {
    workspace_id: UUID
    encrypted_payload: EncryptedEnvelope
    technical_version: integer
  }
}
DrizzleContextRepository --> ContextBusinessRow
DrizzleContextRepository --> ImmutableFact
PostgresUnitOfWork ..> IdempotencyResult
PostgresOutboxAdapter --> OutboxEvent
JobRunner --> InboxConsumption : atomic with consumer effects
JobRunner --> DurableJob
SqlSnapshotQueryAdapter --> ProjectionRecord
note bottom of ContextBusinessRow
  Per-context tables/schemas, not one shared business table.
  Tenant predicates + tenant-safe references are mandatory.
  Interface/API/worker are composition roots; domain imports no adapter.
  Reference catalog exceptions need explicit policy.
end note
note bottom of DurableJob
  Queue payload = job ID/signed envelope, not financial records.
  Bounded retry, checkpoint, dead-letter state and deduplication.
  QStash is a documented pilot candidate, not an installed adapter.
end note
note bottom of ProjectionRecord
  Rebuild through stable source contracts; no cross-context domain SQL.
  Private business fields/lineage stay in encrypted payloads, never raw numeric.
  Decrypt and compute exact Decimal/Money only in authorized trusted memory.
  No plaintext financial SQL views/aggregates; route records by generic metadata.
  Logical record names here do not authorize subtype-revealing physical storage.
  Outbox/inbox/queues/projections here are proposed, not implemented.
end note
@enduml
